{"3869630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Colony 37", "steam_appid": 3869630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >move<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c242dce2ee91aa3828d8873a617d3ae4.poster.avif?t=1773273821\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c242dce2ee91aa3828d8873a617d3ae4.webm?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c242dce2ee91aa3828d8873a617d3ae4.mp4?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colony 37</strong> is a mining game with a <strong>heavy emphasis on exploration, loot hoarding, and simplified survival mechanics</strong>. Explore the hidden depths of a long-forgotten colony, find out the reason why it was abandoned, and earn plenty of credits, items, instruments, and a lot more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/f12258ae27d28a4d14f256e691aacfa2.poster.avif?t=1773273821\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/f12258ae27d28a4d14f256e691aacfa2.webm?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/f12258ae27d28a4d14f256e691aacfa2.mp4?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated block-based world with a depth of 600+ meters.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 underground biomes with their own threats and goods you can find.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven gameplay.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue system with small quests and rewards.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden underground structures that moves the story forward.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radiation, darkness, and lack of oxygen are your constant enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perk system.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/8f81f2476e3cec6de50d582a9a331910.poster.avif?t=1773273821\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/8f81f2476e3cec6de50d582a9a331910.webm?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/8f81f2476e3cec6de50d582a9a331910.mp4?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each biome has its own set of resources for you to gather. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each biome contains</strong> <strong>its own set of items that you can find in underground chests.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The lower you go, the more valuable resources become.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/cebfc6e15b1295ff16bbd9cf52d9d8a1.poster.avif?t=1773273821\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/cebfc6e15b1295ff16bbd9cf52d9d8a1.webm?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/cebfc6e15b1295ff16bbd9cf52d9d8a1.mp4?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell all of your found resources back at the base.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even if you didn't manage to bring back your resources, each destroyed block provides you with experience that you can spend on upgrading your character.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/4175ce6aaaa7c41ad879bd191ccb409d.poster.avif?t=1773273821\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/4175ce6aaaa7c41ad879bd191ccb409d.webm?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/4175ce6aaaa7c41ad879bd191ccb409d.mp4?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players can equip 3 instruments and 10 miscellaneous items. What kind of character build you want to make is completely up to you. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ instruments starting from pickaxes and shovels and ending with flamethrowers, dynamite, drills, and advanced firepower.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ trinkets that you can buy or find. Some of them boost your character's stats (damage, health, movement speed, etc.), while some of them allow you to create explosions with each hit, teleport, or even fly.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ consumables that are acting as emergency boosts of health/oxygen/energy in a tricky situation.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >move<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c242dce2ee91aa3828d8873a617d3ae4.poster.avif?t=1773273821\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c242dce2ee91aa3828d8873a617d3ae4.webm?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/c242dce2ee91aa3828d8873a617d3ae4.mp4?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colony 37</strong> is a mining game with a <strong>heavy emphasis on exploration, loot hoarding, and simplified survival mechanics</strong>. Explore the hidden depths of a long-forgotten colony, find out the reason why it was abandoned, and earn plenty of credits, items, instruments, and a lot more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/f12258ae27d28a4d14f256e691aacfa2.poster.avif?t=1773273821\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/extras/f12258ae27d28a4d14f256e691aacfa2.webm?t=1773273821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati