>40+ instruments starting from pickaxes and shovels and ending with flamethrowers, dynamite, drills, and advanced firepower.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ trinkets that you can buy or find. Some of them boost your character's stats (damage, health, movement speed, etc.), while some of them allow you to create explosions with each hit, teleport, or even fly.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ consumables that are acting as emergency boosts of health/oxygen/energy in a tricky situation.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dig deep down the abandoned planet to find its secrets and earn cash by collecting resources. Spend your money on buying various trinkets and instruments that will help you along the way to earn even more profit.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/044b70978682c62d3770af0404bc176bed768224/header.jpg?t=1773273821", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/52fcf4614479247ba36e8d10a7d92a3d20d28d0b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773273821", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869630/52fcf4614479247ba36e8d10a7d92a3d20d28d0b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773273821", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-8th Gen CPU or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 950 or Radeon HD 7970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Sto